       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. IDMSTEST.
      *
      * Test program exercising CA-IDMS DML patterns:
      * BIND RUN-UNIT, READY, OBTAIN, STORE, MODIFY, ERASE, FINISH.
      *
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       IDMS-CONTROL SECTION.
           PROTOCOL. MODE IS BATCH DEBUG.
           IDMS-RECORDS MANUAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-ERROR-STATUS          PIC X(4).
       01  WS-CUSTOMER-ID           PIC X(10).
       01  WS-CUSTOMER-NAME         PIC X(30).
       01  WS-CUSTOMER-ADDR         PIC X(50).
      *
       SCHEMA SECTION.
           DB CUSTOMER-SCHEMA WITHIN CUSTOMER-SUBSCHEMA.
      *
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           PERFORM 1000-BIND-UNIT
           PERFORM 2000-READY-AREA
           PERFORM 3000-OBTAIN-RECORD
           PERFORM 4000-STORE-RECORD
           PERFORM 5000-MODIFY-RECORD
           PERFORM 6000-ERASE-RECORD
           PERFORM 7000-FINISH
           GOBACK.
       1000-BIND-UNIT.
           BIND RUN-UNIT.
           IF DB-STATUS-CODE NOT = '0000'
               DISPLAY 'BIND FAILED: ' DB-STATUS-CODE
           END-IF.
       2000-READY-AREA.
           READY CUSTOMER-AREA USAGE-MODE UPDATE.
           IF DB-STATUS-CODE NOT = '0000'
               DISPLAY 'READY FAILED: ' DB-STATUS-CODE
           END-IF.
       3000-OBTAIN-RECORD.
           MOVE 'CUST000001' TO CUSTOMER-ID
           OBTAIN CALC CUSTOMER-RECORD.
           IF DB-STATUS-CODE = '0000'
               MOVE CUSTOMER-NAME TO WS-CUSTOMER-NAME
               MOVE CUSTOMER-ADDR TO WS-CUSTOMER-ADDR
           END-IF.
       4000-STORE-RECORD.
           MOVE 'CUST000099' TO CUSTOMER-ID
           MOVE 'NEW CUSTOMER' TO CUSTOMER-NAME
           MOVE '123 MAIN ST' TO CUSTOMER-ADDR
           STORE CUSTOMER-RECORD.
           IF DB-STATUS-CODE NOT = '0000'
               DISPLAY 'STORE FAILED: ' DB-STATUS-CODE
           END-IF.
       5000-MODIFY-RECORD.
           OBTAIN CALC CUSTOMER-RECORD.
           IF DB-STATUS-CODE = '0000'
               MOVE 'UPDATED NAME' TO CUSTOMER-NAME
               MODIFY CUSTOMER-RECORD
           END-IF.
       6000-ERASE-RECORD.
           OBTAIN CALC CUSTOMER-RECORD.
           IF DB-STATUS-CODE = '0000'
               ERASE CUSTOMER-RECORD
           END-IF.
       7000-FINISH.
           FINISH.
